# Xiaomi MiMo-V2.6-Flash with half its experts kept (REAP 50%, by patrickbdevaney), FP4
# experts and 16-bit attention, 92 GB. Trained to a 1M window. Only 9 of its layers attend
# over the whole prompt, so an 8-bit cache of 1M tokens is about 13 GB. The whole model
# does not fit at any useful precision. No published evaluations of this build. MIT.
TITLE="MiMo-V2.6-Flash, REAP 50%"
DETAIL="half the experts kept, FP4 experts, 92 GB"
HF_REPO=patrickbdevaney/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-REAP50-GGUF
HF_INCLUDE="*MXFP4_MOE*"
GGUF_MATCH="MXFP4_MOE"
ALIAS=mimo-v2.6-flash-reap
CTX=fit
CTX_MIN=262144
FIT_MARGIN_MB=8192
KV_TYPE=q8_0
MIN_FREE_GB=95
EXTRA_ARGS="--load-mode dio --cache-ram 0 --timeout 14400 --reasoning on --reasoning-format auto"
